Title: "Overview"
Id: "953b9b74-8be7-4637-9c62-e20447652630"

Text: "`Specify:` is a top-level group for numeric-domain metadata.

```mlg-fragment
Specify:
. positive:
  int:
  is: \"positive integer\"
. zero:
  is: \"zero\"
Id: \"23e4567e-e89b-42d3-a456-426614174000\"
```

Nested specify items may describe positive integers, negative integers, zero, positive decimals, and negative decimals."
Id: "61225453-d003-4cf2-a4b5-0af648b50a9a"
